# Never commit real export data. This repository is public and git history is
# permanent, so the guard is a gitignore rather than a code review habit. A real
# Google Authenticator export QR is the full credential for every account in it.
# See the top of CLAUDE.md. Every fixture in tests/ is generated synthetically by
# scripts/generate-fixtures.ts and verified by hash in CI.
scratch/
*.private.*
real-*.png
real-*.jpg
real-*.jpeg
